.TH KLVTOOL-DECODE 1 "2026-05-06" "klvtool 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH "NAME"
klvtool\-decode \- Decode MISB ST 0601 KLV records.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
klvtool decode \-\-input <file.ts> [\-\-pid N]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Decode MISB ST 0601 KLV.
.PP
Second paragraph for the body.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI(default ndjson)\fR
output format: ndjson, text, csv
.TP
\fB\-\-input\fR
MPEG\-TS input path
.TP
\fB\-\-pid\fR
limit decoding to one PID (0 = all)
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
exit non\-zero if any error diagnostic fires
.SH "OUTPUT FORMAT"
NDJSON, one record per packet.
.SS Fields
.TP
\fBschema\fR (string)
spec URN
.TP
\fBitems[].value\fR (polymorphic; varies)
per\-tag type
.SS Time semantics
Tag 2 is RFC 3339 microsecond UTC.
.SS Schema stability
Schema is stable within 1.x.
.SS Common MISB ST 0601 tags
.TP
\fBTag 2 \(em Precision Time Stamp\fR
wall\-clock at sample time (UTC)
.TP
\fBTag 13 \(em Sensor Latitude\fR (degrees)
WGS\-84
.SH "EXAMPLES"
decode one PID
.RS 4
.nf
$ klvtool decode --input mission.ts --pid 257
.fi
.RE
.PP
decode every PID
.RS 4
.nf
$ klvtool decode --input mission.ts
.fi
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
success
.TP
\fB1\fR
decode failure
.TP
\fB2\fR
invalid usage
.SH "ENVIRONMENT"
.TP
\fBNO_COLOR\fR
disable ANSI color
.SH "FILES"
.TP
\fB<out>\fR
output destination
.SH "REQUIRED TOOLS"
ffmpeg, ffprobe
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBklvtool\fR(1),
\fBklvtool\-inspect\fR(1)
.SH "EXTERNAL REFERENCES"
.TP
\fBMISB ST 0601.19\fR
https://nsgreg.nga.mil/doc/view?i=5337
